    "logic": "Repeat a head profile toward an eccentric point inside the lower face, with two large silhouettes facing each other and smaller border copies facing inward, following the Expérience Collective reference. Source mode uses successive affine scales about a convergence point; copies are clipped to their parent wherever an outline is not star-shaped around that point, so layers never cross. Parallel mode draws true constant-distance vector offsets; a straight cut edge stays open, so channels run off the neck instead of turning along it. Imported SVG or saved M/L/Q/C/Z outlines replace the profile inside the same composition.",
